{"4137570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Head's Adventures:chibichibi", "steam_appid": 4137570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4321080], "detailed_description": "<h1>A Temporary Substitute for Online Co-op</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/85b944dca0a2795ba0ed7117c68abafd.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1242 height=2208 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7dbfc1223d28bdb98401e8bd94b04725.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7dbfc1223d28bdb98401e8bd94b04725.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7dbfc1223d28bdb98401e8bd94b04725.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head's Adventures: chibichibi is a two-player co-op (or co-trolling) adventure game that blends action-jumping and physics simulation. You'll play as a mysterious little witch in dinosaur pajamas, dragged into cyberspace by a cyber devil. Try to find the exit in each fragment of space, while collecting Healing Balloons and completing time races to unlock subsequent spaces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7a2e8dcfc7450a69caee52c62c90d0c2.avif?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the name suggests, the core gameplay revolves around &quot;heads&quot;. You can switch between three heads with unique abilities at any time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/cb6ba9b2a5e370309aa2df72e023010c.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabs onto any platform edge with the lips, allowing you to climb and reach impossible places with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/8669f73b9765dee2449eecec9e2ec362.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boom Head: Detonates after a short countdown, blasting away obstacles... and possibly yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/31a04ae4ff7a7ac1f2180c74ef991f4a.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Head: Allows you to bounce to incredible heights and leap effortlessly across huge gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/8922a6d10cc367d12f4aa8f909ccfc38.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/8922a6d10cc367d12f4aa8f909ccfc38.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/8922a6d10cc367d12f4aa8f909ccfc38.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heads can do more than you ever imagined! Trigger mechanisms to open up new paths, squeeze through cracks, or punt your teammate's head around just for fun... Head-switching madness meets physics-based chaos as you laugh your way through every level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/81a535e849fcdeeb52a14c243a439abc.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/81a535e849fcdeeb52a14c243a439abc.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/81a535e849fcdeeb52a14c243a439abc.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/bba2ce41153af7c0bb34729dce006ef1.avif?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels can be completed solo, but co-op unlocks a whole new world of possibilities and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/cb5f1eedf4665089136cef8aa61b1213.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one player falls, the surviving player can pull their body along within a certain distance and revive them by collecting a Healing Balloon before the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/ba4bee74416eced650b6d953789bc5ca.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/ba4bee74416eced650b6d953789bc5ca.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/ba4bee74416eced650b6d953789bc5ca.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/bcc089d1ef759323eba682ce9c598bd0.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the two players stray too far apart, the screen automatically splits into two views. Once they reunite, the views merge back together—so you'll never have to worry about getting left behind off-screen by your teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/663b11bc8e94e3198deb8555f5fa6129.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/663b11bc8e94e3198deb8555f5fa6129.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/663b11bc8e94e3198deb8555f5fa6129.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/85b93ce6b2db1a1f2eff079b14e68335.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends are here to help... and to mess with each other. Kick your teammate's head like a ball, give them a well-timed boot when they fall, and pull off every prank imaginable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/307c60a6b83c82ffcfd41a2168babd8d.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/307c60a6b83c82ffcfd41a2168babd8d.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/307c60a6b83c82ffcfd41a2168babd8d.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/d0d2d56fcbf736b27941bd0c9f11bdb4.avif?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative gameplay built around three unique heads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo &amp; co-op play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect mix of teamwork and friendly sabotage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and quirky art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Realistic physics with hilarious results</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop support</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7dbfc1223d28bdb98401e8bd94b04725.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7dbfc1223d28bdb98401e8bd94b04725.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7dbfc1223d28bdb98401e8bd94b04725.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head's Adventures: chibichibi is a two-player co-op (or co-trolling) adventure game that blends action-jumping and physics simulation. You'll play as a mysterious little witch in dinosaur pajamas, dragged into cyberspace by a cyber devil. Try to find the exit in each fragment of space, while collecting Healing Balloons and completing time races to unlock subsequent spaces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/7a2e8dcfc7450a69caee52c62c90d0c2.avif?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the name suggests, the core gameplay revolves around &quot;heads&quot;. You can switch between three heads with unique abilities at any time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/cb6ba9b2a5e370309aa2df72e023010c.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabs onto any platform edge with the lips, allowing you to climb and reach impossible places with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/8669f73b9765dee2449eecec9e2ec362.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boom Head: Detonates after a short countdown, blasting away obstacles... and possibly yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/31a04ae4ff7a7ac1f2180c74ef991f4a.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spring Head: Allows you to bounce to incredible heights and leap effortlessly across huge gaps.</p><p 