_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/cb5f1eedf4665089136cef8aa61b1213.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one player falls, the surviving player can pull their body along within a certain distance and revive them by collecting a Healing Balloon before the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/ba4bee74416eced650b6d953789bc5ca.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/ba4bee74416eced650b6d953789bc5ca.webm?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/ba4bee74416eced650b6d953789bc5ca.mp4?t=1785296587\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/bcc089d1ef759323eba682ce9c598bd0.webp?t=1785296587\" width=660 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the two players stray too far apart, the screen automatically splits into two views. Once they reunite, the views merge back together—so you'll never have to worry about getting left behind off-screen by your teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/663b11bc8e94e3198deb8555f5fa6129.poster.avif?t=1785296587\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137570/extras/66